<<img "kavya_final_beat.png" "“Tonight, Kavya.”">>
**End of Day 1   Kavya.**
<div class="thought kavya">Coding <<= $stats.k_coding>> · Medical <<= $stats.k_med>> · Rel Meera <<= $stats.rel_kavya_meera>> · Trust (swap) <<= $stats.trust_meera>> · ₹<<= setup.money("kavya")>> · Mood: <<= $mood.kavya>> · Swap experienced: yes</div>

Tomorrow, everything changes. Or nothing does. With Meera it's always a coin flip   but tonight, for the first time in three years, the coin feels weighted in your favour.

